translate ptBR qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_6b05abff:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Normally, I make the offer and let you think on it."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Normalmente, eu faço a oferta e deixo você pensar."

