translate ptBR qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_58c3d475:

    # GAREN @ smile "I am sure he will obsess over every word of the papers I send, but within a few days at the most we will conclude our business."
    GAREN @ smile "Tenho certeza que ele vai se obcecar com cada palavra dos papéis que eu enviar, mas em no máximo alguns dias concluiremos nossos negócios."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1972
translate ptBR qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_edbe0460:

    # MC @ talk "How can you be so sure?"
    MC @ talk "Como pode ter tanta certeza?"

